  "question": {
    "text": "For <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mn>20</mn></munderover><mfrac><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;Then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>100</mn><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>14</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>15</mn></msub></mrow><msub><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><mn>13</mn></msub></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math> is equal to ____________."
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "9",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>We have,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mn>20</mn></munderover><mfenced><mfrac><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>&#945;</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>20</mn></msub><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>19</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>&#945;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>19</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>20</mn></msub><mi>&#945;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>19</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>19</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>19</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>20</mn></msub><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>19</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi>i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Hence, coefficient of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>13</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>14</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>19</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>.</p><p>Similarly, coefficient of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>14</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>13</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>15</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>19</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>And, coefficient of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>15</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>14</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>19</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Then, to find&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>14</mn></msub></math>, put&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>14</mn></math>&nbsp;in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>i</mi></mfenced></math>, then we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>14</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>13</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>14</mn><mo>!</mo><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Similarly, putting&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>15</mn></math>, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>15</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>15</mn><mo>!</mo><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>And, putting&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>13</mn></math>, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>13</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>13</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>13</mn><mo>!</mo><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Hence,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>14</mn></msub><msub><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><mn>13</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>14</mn><mo>!</mo><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>13</mn><mo>!</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow><mn>14</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>15</mn></msub><msub><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><mn>13</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>15</mn><mo>!</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>13</mn><mo>!</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>42</mn><mrow><mn>15</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>14</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Then,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>100</mn><msup><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>14</mn></msub><msub><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><mn>13</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>15</mn></msub><msub><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><mn>13</mn></msub></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn><msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn></math></p>"
  }
}